  "title": "Coast Guard Sector North Bend medevacs man off cruise ship",
  "description": "An MH-65 Dolphin helicopter aircrew from Sector North Bend medically evacuated an ill man off the cruise ship Norwegian Joy Oct. 8, 2019, 33 miles west of Coos Bay, Ore. The 61-year-old Filipino man was transported to the sector's air base where he was transferred to a Life Flight Network aircrew for further care and transportation Sacred Heart Medical Center at Riverbend in Springfield, Ore. (U.S. Coast Guard video courtesy of Sector North Bend)",
